        "Description": "Hello 47,\r\rAntoine Mack, assistant of Robert Knox, seems to be planning to detonate a bomb at the race, which would interfere with our plans of killing Knox and his daughter. Eliminate the target and leave within 5 minutes so you can defuse the bomb. You must make it seem like noone was there, as if they knew something weird was happening, they would increase security massively.\r\rHappy hunting, 47.",
